title: mf repo toggle-memory
tags: [[CLI command]] Storage
kind: reference
summary: Hold the selected repository in memory, or let go of it

Holds the store of the repository `-n`/`-u` names in memory, or lets go of it if it
already is, without unloading it — the [[GUI command]] [[repos:toggle-memory]] from a
shell; prints `held in memory` or `read on disk`. Refused when the store does not fit
in the room left ([[Holding a repository in memory]]).
